[P_02_CargoShip_BackSideCargoSoldiers]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=PrGeu_E - Ah... I love the smell of the ocean air.
Speech_0004L=PrGeu_F - All I smell is burning oil and vomit.
Speech_0002L=PrGeu_E - Ah... come on... enjoy it while it lasts. Before you know it we'll be sweating it out in some jungle again.
Speech_0005L=PrGeu_F - Never heard of anybody getting scurvy in a jungle.
Speech_0003L=PrGeu_E - And I never heard of anybody getting eaten by an alligator on a ship.

[P_02_CargoShip_BodyGuards]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Damiem - Hey, why don't you pour us a glass too?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=Norman - I'll just have a beer actually...

[P_02_CargoShip_BowNavMesh]

[P_02_CargoShip_BowSoldiers]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Aurelio - What are you doing up here?
Speech_0005L=Hector - Ah... just trying to get away from that jerk Lacerda.
Speech_0002L=Aurelio - Tell me about it. What a pain.
Speech_0006L=Hector - We should kill him and toss him overboard.
Speech_0003L=Aurelio - Yeah. I'd agree with you, but those guys protecting him...
Speech_0007L=Hector - Yeah... you're right. They look dangerous.

[P_02_CargoShip_CaptainCheckGrab]

[P_02_CargoShip_CoffeeRoomSoldiers]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Javiero - Yuch... you know what I don't understand? Here we are loaded up with Colombian... best coffee in the world.
Speech_0009L=Pedro - And the coffee tastes like bat guano.
Speech_0002L=Javiero - Exactly... what's up with that?
Speech_0010L=Pedro - Because Captain Diego buys the cheapest coffee he can find.
Speech_0003L=Javiero - Why?
Speech_0011L=Pedro - Because cheap coffee sweats more. Makes it harder for the dogs to smell what's hidden inside the coffee.
Speech_0004L=Javiero - Ahhh... that makes sense. Still... wouldn't mind a good cup of coffee.
Speech_0012L=Pedro - Tell me about it.

[P_02_CargoShip_Doctor]

[P_02_CargoShip_Emitters]
POPUPMESSAGE_0004=Find out which cabin Lacerda is in
POPUPMESSAGE_0005=Place tracking devices on any illegal weapons crates.

[P_02_CargoShip_EngineSoldiers]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Iago - Euh... did you just...
Speech_0005L=Orlando - No. I thought it was you.
Speech_0002L=Iago - It wasn't me. Man it stinks.
Speech_0006L=Orlando - Smells like... I'm not sure... like gas fumes...
Speech_0003L=Iago - Smells like mud.
Speech_0007L=Orlando - Yeah. Smells like gas fumes from a swamp...
Speech_0004L=Iago - You think it's dangerous.
Speech_0010L=Orlando - Probably not.

[P_02_CargoShip_FirstFloorSoldier]

[P_02_CargoShip_HoldSoldiers]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Nemesio - You going to start that pump there or what?
Speech_0006L=Saul - I don't know how this stupid thing works...
Speech_0002L=Nemesio - Captain Diego says hurry up, or we'll sink.
Speech_0007L=Saul - Well, if I do it wrong we might sink faster.
Speech_0011L=Nemesio - Then don't do it wrong.
Speech_0012L=Saul - Easy for you to say.

[P_02_CargoShip_InteroBedroomOfficer]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Quiet down here...
Speech_0002L=Raul - Ah!
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Quiet and dark... great place to hide a body.
Speech_0004L=Raul - Oh, no... please... I'll tell you anything you want to know.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Tell me what Lacerda is up to.
Speech_0006L=Raul - He's delivering arms to people that he owes favors too. Trying to consolidate support.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - For what?
Speech_0008L=Raul - He believes in the revolution... he's crazy.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0009L=Raul - I have no love for Lacerda... kill him if you want.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=Raul - I'll tell no one.

[P_02_CargoShip_InterogateCaptain]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - I hear you have a special passenger tonight?
Speech_0002L=Capt_Diego - Wh--ah... who?
Speech_0003L=FISHER - I'm the guy who's here to cash the checques Lacerda's been writing...
Speech_0006L=Capt_Diego -That son of a--he was provoking my men, so I gave him my own cabin to shut him up!
Speech_0007L=FISHER - That's very kind of you.
Speech_0008L=Capt_Diego - Be careful... he brought some personal bodyguards... they look dangerous.
Speech_0009L=FISHER - I'm not afraid of Lacerda's thugs...
Speech_0010L=Capt_Diego - No... they're not Peruvian... they're European's I think... pros.
Speech_0011L=FISHER - Hmm. Thanks for the tip.
Speech_0012L=Capt_Diego - The pleasure is all mine.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0013L=Capt_Diego - I'm glad you're here, but my men will still shoot you on sight.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0014L=Capt_Diego - Leave me his corpse so I can feed it the rats.

[P_02_CargoShip_InterogBodyGuards]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Who are you?
Speech_0002L=Damien - Wh--who...
Speech_0003L=FISHER - You're not one of Lacerda's thugs... what are you doing here?
Speech_0004L=Damien - I don't know... I--
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Who are you protecting Lacerda from?
Speech_0006L=Damien - Lacerda has a lot of enemies... he's not very popular.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - What are the guns for?
Speech_0008L=Damien - Lacerda's using them to pay off his debts... win some friends.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0010L=Damien - He wants to organize in Peru... it'll never work.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=Damien - Lacerda doesn't have brains or charisma...

[P_02_CargoShip_InterogBreakSoldBow]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Nice night...
Speech_0002L=Aurelio - Wha--!
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Shhh... what's the roster? How many men aboard?
Speech_0004L=Aurelio - Total? There's thirty six of us I think... but that's including Lacerda and a couple of mean looking mercenaries he brought with him.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Where's Lacerda now?
Speech_0006L=Aurelio - He was just here, twenty minutes ago... complaining about his quarters... he said he wanted another room.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0008L=Aurelio - You won't find Lacerda where there's work to be done.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0009L=Aurelio - Lacerda's probably drunk by now.

[P_02_CargoShip_InterogCoffeeSoldier]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Tell me something useful, or I'll have to hurt you.
Speech_0002L=Pedro - Oh no... please...
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Don't beg... it's pathetic.
Speech_0004L=Pedro - Uh... okay... uh... there's not much on this deck... cafeteria, mostly. Upstairs there's the officers quarters... quiet a few men up there.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0017L=Pedro - Last I heard, Captain Diego let Lacerda take his quarters... up one deck.
Speech_0018L=FISHER - Awfully nice of the Captain...
Speech_0019L=Pedro - He couldn't stand Lacerda's complaining any longer... no one can.
Speech_0020L=FISHER - I'll go shut him up for you then.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=FISHER - You look like one of Lacerda's men...
Speech_0006L=Pedro - Ah... uh... yes... that's right.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Too bad for you... tell me where I can find him.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0021L=Pedro - He's been wandering around in a bad mood... said he was going to talk to the Captain about getting better quarters.
Speech_0022L=FISHER - So the Captain might know where he is?
Speech_0023L=Pedro - I guess so.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0015L=Pedro - I'm not really a bad guy.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0016L=Pedro - I'm afraid of dying.

[P_02_CargoShip_InterogEngineFenceS]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Stay calm... we don't want to make any sparks.
Speech_0002L=Iago - Wh... who are you?
Speech_0003L=FISHER - I'm the fire inspector, and I'm worried that you or one of your stupid friends might try and squeeze a shot off in here.
Speech_0004L=Iago - Wh--why?
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Can't you smell the gas?
Speech_0006L=Iago - But... but I didn't think it was dangerous...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Say you guys need to stow your ammo to prevent any accidents.... where would you put it.
Speech_0008L=Iago - Uh...the men bunk up portside... just turn left out the back of the engine room... they've got a crate full of new guns back there, maybe some other stuff too... not sure.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0009L=Iago - I won't fire my weapon, I promise.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0010L=Iago - I won't even light a match.

[P_02_CargoShip_InterogLacerda]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Don't bother begging, you're already dead.
Speech_0004L=LACERDA - Wh... what did I do?
Speech_0010L=FISHER - Small matter of ordering an execution...
Speech_0011L=LACERDA - I... no... I didn't...
Speech_0012L=FISHER - Morgenholt. Your men tortured him to death...
Speech_0013L=LACERDA - I... no... please... arrest me... put me on trial... I don't want to die...
Speech_0014L=FISHER - Tell me something really juicy and maybe I'll let you live...
Speech_0015L=LACERDA - I was hired... you know... to kidnap and interrogate him.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=FISHER - By who?
Speech_0006L=LACERDA - I don't know... they only dealt with me anonymously... they must be pretty powerful...
Speech_0016L=FISHER - Interesting... but not enough to save your life...
Speech_0017L=LACERDA - No... no... wait... please...
Speech_0018L=FISHER - Save your breath. You only have a few left.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0019L=FISHER - Shh... let's not make a scene.
Speech_0020L=LACERDA - Ulp... madre de dios...
Speech_0021L=FISHER - Not exactly... but if it makes you feel better to pray...
Speech_0022L=LACERDA - Please don't kill me...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0023L=FISHER - Calm him down...
Speech_0024L=LACERDA - Uh... uh, yeah... I'm looking for some rum.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0025L=LACERDA - No... no... I'll find it....
Speech_0026L=FISHER - Good job.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0027L=LACERDA - Please, let me go... I won't tell them I saw you.
Speech_0028L=FISHER - You don't understand what's happening here, do you? Morgenholt... your goons tortured him to death, and I'm holding you responsible.
Speech_0029L=LACERDA - Oh... no... it's not my fault...
Speech_0030L=FISHER - The only thing worse than a coward is a liar. You gave the order, and now you're going to die for it.
Speech_0031L=LACERDA - Please...
Speech_0032L=FISHER - First, tell me who contracted you to kidnap him.
Speech_0033L=LACERDA - I... I don't know... I swear... I was contacted indirectly... I was warned not to try and find out...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0034L=LACERDA - Uh... just a sec! You better let me go... or they'll come looking.
Speech_0035L=FISHER - You wish.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0038L=LACERDA - I am a coward... please...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0039L=LACERDA - I am sorry... it's not my fault...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0040L=LACERDA - I don't deserve this.

[P_02_CargoShip_InterogMShopSailor]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Boo.
Speech_0002L=Ruben - My god... how did...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - I'll ask the questions... tell me about the launch.
Speech_0006L=Ruben - The launch?
Speech_0007L=FISHER - The boat up there on the rack.
Speech_0008L=Ruben - All you have to do is pull the lever up there and get in... what else do you need to know?
Speech_0009L=FISHER - It's not mined or anything?
Speech_0010L=Ruben - Are you crazy? Why would we mine a lifeboat?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=Ruben - Go ahead and take the launch... be glad to see you go.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=Ruben - Don't let me stop you.

[P_02_CargoShip_InterogOfficeSoldier]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - What are you doing here?
Speech_0002L=Stefano - I would ask you the same.
Speech_0003L=Fisher - I have a knife... you go first.
Speech_0004L=Stefano - Right. Uh... I'm supposed to patrol around the office and the infirmary...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - What else is o this deck?
Speech_0006L=Stefano - Nothing. One deck up is the galley and the cafeteria. Below us is the engine room.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0007L=Stefano - I don't know more... it's my second day aboard.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0008L=Stefano - If you're going to hurt me, at least leave me near the infirmary.

[P_02_CargoShip_InterogPumpUpSoldier]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Noisy down here...
Speech_0002L=Saul - Oh my--
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Makes it easy to sneak up on people... what is this hold?
Speech_0004L=Saul - The auxiliary pump is here... there are some flooded compartments... the pump should be able to drain them.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Thanks for the information.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0007L=Saul - I'm new at this whole revolutionary thing.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0008L=Saul - I don't want to die.

[P_02_CargoShip_InterogServerSoldier]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - What's in here?
Speech_0002L=Gustavo - Wha... how... where did you come from?
Speech_0003L=Fisher - Nevermind that... I'm looking for Hugo Lacerda.
Speech_0004L=Gustavo - Uh... It think the Captain probably just logged a memo about room assignments on the server.
Speech_0005L=Fisher - Server hunh?
Speech_0006L=Gustavo - Well... basically... technically it's a server... but it's a piece of junk.
Speech_0007L=Fisher - As long as it tells me what I want to know.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0008L=Gustavo - Please, let me go.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0009L=Gustavo - I've never hurt anyone.

[P_02_CargoShip_InterogTopDeckSold]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - There are a lot of guys up here...
Speech_0002L=Vincente - Oh no... uh... uh... yeah... it stinks on this rat trap... the fresh air is nice...
Speech_0003L=FISHER - What's up here?
Speech_0004L=Vincente  - Just the communication and server rooms and the observation platform.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Anything else?
Speech_0006L=Vincente - There's an emergency ladder down to the launch at the stern.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0009L=Vincente - I don't know anything else.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=Vincente - I didn't do anything wrong.

[P_02_CargoShip_InteroQuartCrowSold]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Nice cabins here.
Speech_0002L=Mauricio - Wha! Who... uh... yeah... these are the officers quarters... the Captain's quarters are just down the hall.
Speech_0003L=FISHER - So you're an officer?
Speech_0004L=Mauricio - No... just a passenger... travelling with Lacerda... they let us use their quarters.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - You must be important guests.
Speech_0006L=Mauricio - I think Lacerda is paying the Captain very well.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - In arms?
Speech_0008L=Mauricio - I... I think so.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0010L=Mauricio - If you're after Lacerda, watch out for his bodyguards.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=Mauricio - I don't want to die on this rusty old hulk.

[P_02_CargoShip_LambertComms]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Fisher, we just pulled up Celestinia's last dry-dock report for the Maria Narcissa. They have a newly installed central alarm system.
Speech_0012L=FISHER - Don't tell me... three alarms and the mission is over?
Speech_0010L=LAMBERT - Of course not... this is no video game Fisher. But you don't want the whole place alerted to your presence... keep it under control.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0025L=REDDING - Fisher, we just intercepted a radio call form the Maria Narcissa... she's reporting a hull leak and asking for an escort.
Speech_0026L=FISHER - The ship is sinking?
Speech_0027L=REDDING - No, but apparently several compartments are flooded. You'll need to activate the bilge in the forward machine room to access all the cargo holds.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0110L=REDDING - Fisher, some of the cargo hold are flooded. You'll need to activate the bilge pump in the machine room in the forecastle.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0033L=REDDING - Fisher, it looks like Lacerda is spreading around his new found wealth... paying off his debts with some of the arms that were delivered to him. 
Speech_0034L=FISHER - You want me to scan any more weapons crates.
Speech_0035L=REDDING - Better idea... plant tracking devices on them and we can see who they end up getting delivered to.
Speech_0036L=FISHER - Okay.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0028L=REDDING - There should be a large pump in here that you can use to drain the forward cargo hold.
Speech_0029L=FISHER - I'll find it.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0030L=REDDING - Fisher, those compartments are flooded. You need to activate the emergency bilge pump to drain them.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0037L=REDDING - Good work Sam. That drained the flooded compartments.
Speech_0038L=REDDING - Fisher, some of the cargo hold are flooded. You'll need to activate the bilge pump in the machine room in the forecastle.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0031L=REDDING - Good job. That'll drain the flooded compartments. Now you can search them for the bill of lading attached to Lacerda's shipment.
Speech_0032L=FISHER - Alright.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0111L=REDDING - Good work Sam. That drained the flooded compartments.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0039L=REDDING - Good job Sam. That's the first crate. Keep your eyes peeled for any more.
Speech_0040L=FISHER - Alright.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0041L=REDDING - Okay Sam... judging by the numbering on the crates, that's about half of them. See if you can find the rest.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0042L=REDDING - Good job Sam. Two more crates to go.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0043L=REDDING - Way to go, Fisher, one more crate to go.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0044L=REDDING - That was the last of the weapons crates, Sam. Now we'll be able to track them wherever they go and see just how connected Lacerda is.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0045L=REDDING - That's the last weapons crate Sam. Good job.
Speech_0046L=REDDING - More weapons crates on the ship Sam. See if you can plant a tracking device on each of them.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0006L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sensors in your suit are detecting a lot of fumes down there.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Yeah... I can smell it... some kind of gas leak.
Speech_0017L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Could be enough to be a serious explosive hazard. We can't have any firing in the engine room...
Speech_0018L=FISHER - Wonderful.
Speech_0019L=GRIMDOTTIR - And don't expect the enemy to be smart enough to realize that. They might still open fire on you if they see you...
Speech_0020L=FISHER - I get the message... I'll be discreet.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0105L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, the engine room has a gas leak. No firing in there. Not even a spark.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0021L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, the engine room has a gas leak. No firing in there. Not even a spark.
Speech_0076L=GRIMSDOTTIR - The bill of lading says that the arms were delivered to Lacerda using a Panamanian offshore bank as a proxy.
Speech_0090L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Lacerda's ledgers are forged. The shipment is transited under the name Nakariakov... a code name used by Philippine arms dealers.  
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0054L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Fisher, you just passed the only compartment that you haven't been through. You should see if Lacerda's shipping container is in there.
Speech_0055L=FISHER - Thanks for the tip.
POPUPMESSAGE_0118=Retrieve the bill of lading for Lacerda's arms shipment.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0056L=GRIMSDOTTIR - I'm betting that Lacerda's shipping container is somewhere in this compartment. The bill of lading should be mounted on the side.
Speech_0057L=FISHER - I'll have a look around.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0058L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good work Sam... it looks like whoever delivered these arms to Lacerda was operating through a proxy.
Speech_0059L=FISHER - Who?
Speech_0060L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Mercantil Costa Afuerda Securidad de Panama.
Speech_0061L=FISHER - Off shore bankers?
Speech_0062L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Yeah... the cigar chomping kind.
Speech_0063L=FISHER - Great... I love bureaucrats.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0106L=GRIMSDOTTIR - The bill of lading says that the arms were delivered to Lacerda using a Panamanian offshore bank as a proxy.
Speech_0077L=GRIMSDOTTIR - That completes all of your primary objectives. Get to extraction whenever you want.
Speech_0078L=FISHER - Alright.
Speech_0079L=GRIMSDOTTIR - You still need to recover the transit ledgers so we can figure out who else Lacerda is dealing with. Try the ship's office... they should have that information.
POPUPMESSAGE_0101=Retrieve the ship's transit ledger for Lacerda's shipment.
Speech_0080L=GRIMSDOTTIR - You still need to find out where Lacerda is holed up.
Speech_0081L=FISHER - The captain probably knows where he is.
Speech_0082L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good idea... why don't you head to the bridge and ask.
Speech_0135L=LAMBERT - They might have logged a record of his room assignment in the ship's computer. The radio and communications center is topside.
Speech_0083L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Now all you need to do is keep your date with Lacerda. He's in the captain's quarters.
Speech_0084L=FISHER - I forgot to bring a corsage.
POPUPMESSAGE_0102=Eliminate Hugo Lacerda
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0085L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, you're near the ship's office. This deck, starboard side.
Speech_0086L=FISHER - I'll find the transit ledgers there?
Speech_0087L=GRIMSDOTTIR - That's where they should be keeping them.
POPUPMESSAGE_0119=Retrieve the ship's transit ledger for Lacerda's shipment.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=GRIMSDOTTIR - The transit ledgers are forged. They say Lacerda's container is full of sugarcane and coconuts from a man named Nakariakov in Malaysia. 
Speech_0064L=FISHER - Nakariakov... I remember that name.
Speech_0065L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Nakariakov is a code name that Philippine drug dealers use to indicate arms shipments. 
Speech_0066L=FISHER - So instead of nuts from Malaysia, Lacerda got guns from an imaginary Russian?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0107L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Lacerda's ledgers are forged. The shipment is transited under the name Nakariakov... a code name used by Philippine arms dealers.  
Speech_0088L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Exactly. All of your primary objectives are complete, Sam. Get to extraction whenever you want.
Speech_0089L=FISHER - Alright.
Speech_0067L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Exactly. But se still need to find the actual bill of lading. Head back below decks into the cargo holds.
Speech_0068L=FISHER - On my way.
POPUPMESSAGE_0103=Retrieve the bill of lading for Lacerda's arms shipment.
Speech_0069L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Exactly. Now why don't you go find out where Lacerda is hiding.
Speech_0070L=FISHER - The captain probably knows where he is.
Speech_0071L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good idea... why don't you head to the bridge and ask.
Speech_0136L=LAMBERT - They might have logged a record of his room assignment in the ship's computer. The radio and communications center is topside.
Speech_0072L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Exactly. Now all you need to do is keep your date with Lacerda. He's in the captain's quarters.
Speech_0073L=FISHER - I forgot to bring a corsage.
POPUPMESSAGE_0104=Eliminate Hugo Lacerda
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0022L=LAMBERT - Dammit Fisher... was probably the only person aboard who knows where Lacerda is.
Speech_0023L=FISHER - I guess I'll have to sweep the whole ship.
Speech_0024L=LAMBERT - They might have logged a record of his room assignment in the ship's computer. The radio and communications center is topside.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0108L=LAMBERT - Fisher, the Captain might have logged a record of Lacerda's room assignment on the ships server. Check the top deck to find out where Lacerda is.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0091L=LAMBERT - So Lacerda is holed up in the Captain's quarters...
Speech_0092L=FISHER - Where is that?
Speech_0093L=LAMBERT - Third deck, port side. The two interior stairwells are the only access to that deck.
