Note_0035L=A medical kit is located in the infirmary.
Note_0036L=A medical kit is located crew quarters washroom next to the engine room.
Note_0037L=A medical kit is located on the bridge.
Note_0038L=There is a gas leak in the engine room. Any firing will cause an explosion.
Note_0039L=There is a gas leak in the engine room. Any firing will destroy the ship.
Note_0040L=Lacerda's shipping container is located in the flooded forward-most hold.
Note_0041L=The flooded compartments can be drained using the pump in the forecastle.
Note_0042L=The crew are vagabonds and guerillas - not civilians. They are armed.
Note_0043L=The ship has an active alarm system. Be careful.
Note_0044L=The Captain will know which room Lacerda is in.
Note_0045L=The server in the room on the top deck will list Lacerda's room assignation.
Note_0046L=Lacerda is in the Captain's quarters, below the bridge to the stern.
Note_0047L=Lacerda is being guarded by professional mercenaries.
Note_0048L=The ship's launch is located on the stern outer deck.
Note_0049L=The ship's launch can be used for extraction.
Note_0050L=In an emergency, extraction is over the side of the boat.
Note_0051L=There is a vent connecting the forward machine shop and the forecastle.
Note_0052L=Hugo Lacerda managed to get away from the lighthouse aboard the Maria Narcissa before you could get to him. Board the ship, locate him, and make sure that he is never able to communicate what he may have learned from Morgenholt.
Note_0053L=Killing, setting off alarms, and being detected reduces your Mission Rating.
Note_0054L=Hugo Lacerda managed to get away from the lighthouse aboard the Maria Narcissa before you could get to him. Board the ship, locate him, and make sure that he is never able to communicate what he may have learned from Morgenholt.
Note_0055L=Sliding doors roll in wheeled tracks. The Optic Cable can't be used.
Note_0056L=Interrogating enemies provides lots of useful intelligence.
Note_0057L=If you fail a Secondary Objective, you must complete it in a later mission.
Note_0058L=Opportunity Objectives are optional, but failing them lowers Mission Rating.
Note_0059L=Enemies may use flares if they search in the dark.
Note_0060L=Enemies can pair up to search or fight in teams.

[P_02_CargoShip_OfficeAndInfirmary]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=Stefano - Hey, did Lacerda pass through here?
Speech_0005L=Ernesto - Yeah... he was here a few minutes ago... complaining about the ledgers. Bastard. I hope someone cuts his throat.
Speech_0001L=Stefano - Lacerda is not a man to trifle with.
Speech_0006L=Ernesto - I'm not going to trifle with him... I'm hoping someone else will do it.
Speech_0002L=Stefano - That someone would experience painful death at Lacerda's fearsome hands.
Speech_0007L=Ernesto - Mm-hmm.
Speech_0003L=Stefano - Where is Lacerda now?
Speech_0008L=Ernesto - I don't know, and I don't want to know.

